      "id": "2026-10-28-block-menu-keep-touch-selection-editors-ed1b993a",
      "kind": "fix",
      "summary": "On a touch screen, a long press or a double tap in an editor with the block menu now keeps the browser's own word selection and its Copy menu. Before, a long press turned the paragraph into a block selection, and Paste then replaced the whole paragraph.",
